            "detailed_description": "Parkour is a runner game with tons of challenges. Your objective is simple - try to run as far as possible.<br />\r\nThe levels are randomly generated. The difficulty increases as you run farther.<br />\r\nLava, monsters, powerups &amp; your quick &quot;decision making&quot; will change your fate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures :<br />\r\n- Randomly generated chunks<br />\r\n- Powerups (speed, points, invincibility, health)<br />\r\n- Various obstacles (lava, spikes, monsters)<br />\r\n- Different levels can be explored as you run farther<br />\r\n- Achievements &amp; leaderboard (Google Play, Steam)",
